{"id":"64f6348f5d9119d6","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-free-algebra.md","title":"Free Algebra in a Variety","display":"df-free-algebra — Free Algebra in a Variety","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-free-algebra","aliases":["93-df-free-algebra"],"display":"df-free-algebra — Free Algebra in a Variety","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-free-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-free-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-algebra — Free Algebra in a Variety"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is a set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span> is the homomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:X\\to|\\mathbf F|\">\\(\\eta:X\\to|\\mathbf F|\\)</span> names its universal generators.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf F,\\eta,X,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf F\\in\\mathcal V\\land\\eta:X\\to|\\mathbf F|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall f:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\;\n\\exists!h\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf F,\\mathbf A)\\land h\\circ\\eta=f\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf F,\\eta,X,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf F\\in\\mathcal V\\land\\eta:X\\to|\\mathbf F|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall f:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\;\n\\exists!h\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf F,\\mathbf A)\\land h\\circ\\eta=f\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generator map is part of the data. The universal property, not an untyped phrase “generated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>,” determines freeness and uniqueness up to unique isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ is the homomorphism predicate of [[93-df-homomorphism]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:X\\to|\\mathbf F|","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf F,\\eta,X,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf F\\in\\mathcal V\\land\\eta:X\\to|\\mathbf F|\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall f:X\\to|\\mathbf A|\\;\n\\exists!h\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf F,\\mathbf A)\\land h\\circ\\eta=f\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1171,"backlinks":[{"id":"a015fcd24d4b916f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"259a663bdd529644","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeAlg}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-free-algebra]] and [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-free-algebra]]"}],"outgoing":["f0b0edbaa6696a1d","f10e7e3251fa7f7d"]}